         Join Lookup Index: lca_rows_k
         Join Cond: (s.a = k)
         Group Strategy: Cells
         Cell Columns: lca_rows_x (x), lca_rows_gy.g (g), lca_rows_z (z)
         Cell Predicates: (x = 1), (x = ANY ('{2,3}'::integer[])), (g = ANY ('{2,3}'::integer[])), (g IS NULL), (z = 99)
         Cells: 18
